## Heuristic layer, not a premise

Use mpmath at 110 decimal digits on the midpoint of the fresh enclosure to
propose four complete U(4) phase coordinates alpha_j=arg(lambda_j)/(2pi). Form the integer lattice
with first row [1,round(10^70 alpha_1),...,round(10^70 alpha_4)] and four
remaining diagonal rows [0,10^70 e_j]. A deterministic exact-Fraction LLL
style reduction (delta=3/4) is bounded by 10000 loop iterations. Among the
at most five resulting nonzero first coordinates of magnitude <=10^80,
